  "description": "A modular RPG engine for C# and Unity with batteries-included gameplay systems: turn-based combat (status effects, damage types, a Pokemon-style type chart, capture, mid-battle swap, per-move PP), a stat-modifier pipeline, inventory, equipment, crafting, dialogue, quests, economy, shops, loot, encounters, exploration, party rosters, evolution, bestiary, and versioned JSON saves. Modules compose through an event/reactor pipeline, and every change runs as an atomic, fully deterministic command — making saves, replays, and lockstep multiplayer reliable. Targets netstandard2.1 for Unity 2022.3+.",
